     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Kipp,<br><br>Sorry for taking so long to get back to you.<br><br>We think the problem was caused by those features that have extremely large coordinates. The upper limit on the chromosomal coordinates featureCounts can process is 2^31. But you have coordinates much bigger than this in your annotation.<br><br>Even if featureCounts can process these large coordinates, these features would not get counts because the coordinates in your bam file are less than 2^31.<br><br>Best wishes,<br>Wei<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
